 C/HIDE:,NAME,
C===========================================================
C C/HIDE / C/EDIH - save/restore M6, M7, M8 and M13 (one module, two
C entries).  C/HIDE pushes them and jumps to the caller's link in M14;
C C/EDIH pops them back and returns the same way.  Used by printf and
C the packed-character writers (C/7A, C/A7, C/WO) to free M6..M8 as
C scratch while keeping the caller's own use of those registers intact
C across the call.
C
C This is a verbatim port of the Pascal runtime's P/HIDE/P/EDIH
C (paslib/p_hide.dtran).  Structure and content are otherwise
C unexamined; the fixpoint check and full test suite verify it.
C===========================================================
                ,ITA ,13
                ,ITS ,8
                ,ITS ,7
                ,ITS ,6
           15   ,ATX ,
           14   ,UJ  ,
C===========================================================
 C/EDIH:,ENTRY,
C===========================================================
           15   ,XTA ,
                ,STI ,6
                ,STI ,7
                ,STI ,8
                ,ATI ,13
           14   ,UJ  ,
                ,END ,
